lass=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>公式里最容易被忽略的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{std}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{plat}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的区别：前者是<strong>法律地位</strong>终止，后者是<strong>商业接受度</strong>终止。一份报告可能法律上仍然有效，但平台已经不收——这正是&quot;报告没过期却被下架&quot;的典型成因。</p>\n<p>同时存在的是<strong>记录保留期</strong>，它与有效期是两个方向相反的约束：技术文件与符合性声明需要在产品投放市场后长期留存，欧盟 GPSR 要求制造商保留技术文件<strong>10 年</strong>（Regulation (EU) 2023/988 第 9(2) 条）；而实验室侧对原始记录与报告通常要求保存不少于 6 年（资质认定评审准则）。保留期的含义是&quot;作废了也要留着备查&quot;，绝不是&quot;有效期内&quot;。把保留期误读为有效期，会让团队在报告事实上已被取代后仍继续使用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期限类型</th>\n<th>典型长度</th>\n<th>由谁设定</th>\n<th>超期/到点后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准过渡期</td>\n<td>视标准公告而定</td>\n<td>标准组织/监管机构</td>\n<td>旧报告失去判定依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台新鲜度</td>\n<td>常见约 12 个月</td>\n<td>平台合规政策、买家合同</td>\n<td>文件被退回、Listing 受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品变更时刻</td>\n<td>事件驱动，无固定长度</td>\n<td>制造商自身变更</td>\n<td>报告与实物不符，等同无报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记录保留期</td>\n<td>欧盟 10 年；实验室侧常见 ≥6 年</td>\n<td>法规与认可规则</td>\n<td>缺失属记录管理缺陷，非报告失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把三条时间轴接进业务流程\">把三条时间轴接进业务流程</h2><p>管理动作应当落在<strong>签发的那一刻</strong>，而不是等到清关被拒。建议在报告入库时一并登记四个字段并把它们变成可查询的条件：签发日期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{issue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、依据标准版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、适用的产品与部件范围、以及预期买家/平台的时效要求。任何一个字段变化，都触发一次复用判定（上节的五要素全等）而不是重复全测。</p>\n<p>对化学品这类高频变动项尤其要设监控：REACH 高关注物质（SVHC）候选清单自 2008 年起<strong>每半年更新一次</strong>，截至 2025 年 6 月更新后已达约 250 项（ECHA，Candidate List）。清单入列即可能触发信息传递与 SCIP 申报义务，产品若含超 0.1% 的入列物质，就需要重新评估技术文件——这类事件与产品是否变更无关，纯粹由<strong>外部规则变动</strong>触发，因此必须靠日历提醒而非变更流程来捕获。</p>\n<p>一句话收束这套纪律：<strong>报告不是一次性的通关道具，而是一条需要持续维护的时间轴</strong>——版本管住&quot;改&quot;，复用管住&quot;省&quot;，有效期管住&quot;何时必须重来&quot;。三者都在报告签发当天就该开始生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>检测报告没有普适的法定到期日，真正终结它的是标准换版、产品变更、平台新鲜度三类事件。</li>\n<li>报告更正必须走修订流程：新版本号 + 唯一标识 + 引用原报告编号 + 说明修改原因（ISO/IEC 17025:2017 7.8.8），禁止覆盖原文件。</li>\n<li>复用判定看五要素是否全等：材料、结构、工艺、受众、标准版本；变更只涉单一部件且不影响其他部件时，可依法缩小重测范围（16 CFR § 1107.23）。</li>\n<li>实际有效期取三个截止日的最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{eff}=\\min(t_{std},\\,t_{issue}+t_{plat},\\,t_{chg})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，法律有效与商业接受是两回事。</li>\n<li>记录保留期与有效期方向相反：GPSR 要求技术文件保留 10 年，实验室侧常见不少于 6 年，保留不等于有效。</li>\n<li>外部规则变动（如 REACH SVHC 每半年更新）需要靠日历监控而非变更流程捕获。</li>\n<li>相关阅读：同章节的实验室资质与认可范围判定见 <a href=\"../lab-accreditation-sampling/lab-accreditation-framework\">实验室资质体系：CNAS/CMA/ILAC-MRA 与 ISO 17025</a>；法规与标准版本的对照起点见 <a href=\"../test-standard-scope/test-standard-regulatory-matrix\">检测标准与法规矩阵：国标/欧标/美标对照</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"报告版本、复用与有效期管理","id":"报告版本-复用与有效期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"版本管理：报告更正走的是修订流程，不是重写","id":"版本管理-报告更正走的是修订流程-不是重写"},{"level":2,"text":"复用：一份报告能覆盖多少货","id":"复用-一份报告能覆盖多少货"},{"level":2,"text":"有效期：三类事实截止日与它们的取小","id":"有效期-三类事实截止日与它们的取小"},{"level":2,"text":"把三条时间轴接进业务流程","id":"把三条时间轴接进业务流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"检测报告数据模型与关键字段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/thirdparty-test-lab-compliance/test-report-lifecycle/test-report-data-model"},"next":{"title":"报告真伪验证与篡改识别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/thirdparty-test-lab-compliance/test-report-lifecycle/report-authenticity-and-verification"}}